  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0e90c78c-9441-4a8f-8219-c25c42854423"],
 " times the degree of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["HBar"]], "paclet:ChernSimons/ref/HBar", 
    "ChernSimons Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "e3bf5e3b-e9e4-45fc-8017-75f63c431320"],
 ", and a sum has a degree when all its terms have the same one."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"e13f11a0-b4d3-4966-ad8b-6b13bcd3f7c0"],

Cell["\<\
A scalar multiple of a particle counts only when the scalar contains no \
particle.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"95547de5-f27b-4e7e-be8c-993ff645d777"],

Cell["\<\
The particles of the dual alphabet of a pairing object have their degrees too.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"651e1569-127e-4c86-8c8b-757a30aaa09c"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "In the bar grading ",
 StyleBox["pairing", "TI"],
 " may also be an association from particles to degrees."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"6da157d4-878c-403c-8557-d32c9ca22856"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A sum of mixed degree, ",
